name: Whimsy Dicetricks
author: for pi — Perkeo + Hieroglyph + Showman + Negative skip-tag + stacked Oops/copy core + lucky ladder
description: >
  Perkeo from early packs; Hieroglyph voucher ante 1; Showman early (antes 1-3)
  so the Oops can stack; Negative small-blind Tag ante 4; Oops! All 6s in the
  ante-4 shop (slots 2-4) as a must. Should: stacked Oops at antes 4 and 5, the
  copy/retrigger core, and the lucky hit-stream ladders (money + mult, 8 to 1).
  Anaglyph so every skip tag doubles.
deck: Anaglyph
stake: White

must:
  - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
    antes: [4]
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [1,2,3]
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1,2,3]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [4]
    sources:
      shopItems: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]
    score: 100
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [5]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0,1,2]
    score: 100
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [6]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0,1,2]
    score: 100
  - jokers: [LuckyCat, Blueprint, Brainstorm, InvisibleJoker, SockAndBuskin, HangingChad]
    antes: [4]
    sources:
      shopItems: [2, 3, 4, 5]
    score: 33
  - jokers: [LuckyCat, Blueprint, Brainstorm, InvisibleJoker, SockAndBuskin, HangingChad]
    antes: [5]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0,1]
    score: 33
  - luckyMoney: [0]
